Strategy: Impact of climate risks and opportunities on financial planning, operations, and resilience.
Risk Management: How climate risks are identified, assessed, and integrated into broader risk frameworks.
Metrics & Targets: Climate-related KPIs, Scope 1 & 2 GHG emissions (mandatory), and other relevant disclosures.
Compliance & Review:
