Public sector bodies must provide a TCFD Compliance Statement outlining adherence to disclosure requirements.
Alignment with International Standards:
The guidance is compatible with UK Sustainability Reporting Standards (UK SRS) (expected in 2025), Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) Climate Disclosure Rules, and Paris Agreement commitments.
This framework enhances climate-related financial transparency in UK public sector reporting, supporting better policy alignment and risk mitigation.', 'This guidance, issued by HM Treasury, provides a structured approach for UK public sector entities to adopt TCFD-aligned climate-related financial disclosures in their annual reports. The guidance aims to improve climate risk transparency, enhance decision-making, and align public sector reporting with private sector standards.

